        "text_PiX6Xe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-10",
            "title": "OUR STORY",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_color": "",
            "subheading": "",
            "text": "<p>My name is Stefany Molina, I am Peruvian and currently live in Japan. A Business Administrator by profession and passionate about jewelry and fashion in general.</p><p>Art has always been present in my life, and from a very young age I felt that passion for design. I created Epiphany Accesorios in late 2017, while studying an International Marketing PADE in Peru.</p><p>Over the years, Epiphany has evolved and found its true identity. Today it is a family brand of artisanal, trend-driven accessories where I craft my own designs using various jewelry, weaving, and bead-embroidery techniques, 100% handmade.</p><p>We also have a trendy jewelry line that complements the rest of our pieces in both style and quality.</p>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "left",
            "padding_left": 20,
            "padding_right": 20,
            "align_content_container": "none",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "width": "50%",
            "mobile_color_scheme": "",
            "mobile_padding_left": 15,
            "mobile_padding_right": 15,
            "block_custom_class": "",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_QmmcQx",
        "text_PiX6Xe"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "container": "container",
        "color_schema": "background-1",
