    "custom_content_gcYmxM": {
      "type": "custom-content",
      "blocks": {
        "text_A8ydNQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-10",
            "title": "THE INSPIRATION",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_color": "",
            "subheading": "",
            "text": "<p>Majestic nature, my Peruvian roots and culture, female empowerment, fashion, and the emotional journey I have experienced throughout my life have all been sources of inspiration in my designs. Every collection has a story to tell, a message, and a special essence — whether in its colors, shapes, or even the textures I use. I explore different jewelry styles without losing the identity and the details that make us unique. In the end, the result in our pieces always conveys femininity, artisanal craft, and style.</p>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "left",
            "padding_left": 20,
            "padding_right": 20,
            "align_content_container": "none",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "width": "50%",
            "mobile_color_scheme": "",
            "mobile_padding_left": 15,
            "mobile_padding_right": 15,
            "block_custom_class": "",
