        "text_UY7htX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-10",
            "title": "OUR JEWELRY",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_color": "",
            "subheading": "",
            "text": "<p>Every accessory is made with quality materials to ensure it lasts for years to come. From crystals, pearls, charms, threads, findings, and clasps to the crimps, everything is carefully chosen from trusted, recognized suppliers. The MIYUKI Delicas — the raw material for many of our products — are purchased directly from MIYUKI FACTORY, a Japanese company renowned worldwide for manufacturing quality beads.</p><p>We are committed to quality throughout the entire crafting process and even after-sales, ensuring every piece is unique and special.</p>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "left",
            "padding_left": 20,
            "padding_right": 20,
            "align_content_container": "none",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "width": "50%",
            "mobile_color_scheme": "",
            "mobile_padding_left": 15,
            "mobile_padding_right": 15,
            "block_custom_class": "",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        }
      },
